T CapabilitySet                     | VulkanExchange.h | 25-33 | nonallocating,nonthrowing | -  | What the created device is capable of, scored once and consulted thereafter. path becomes conditional on something that cannot change, and those conditionals never all leave.
    has   ComputeRasterAvailable   bool           [-]  ?
    has   HalfPrecisionStore       bool           [-]  ?
    has   TimestampQueryAvailable  bool           [-]  ?
    has   GraphicsFamilyOrdinal    std::uint32_t  [-]  ?
    has   LargestExtentClaim       std::uint64_t  [-]  ?
    has   TimestampToMilliseconds  double         [-]  ?
    by    Api/VendorClassifier.h, Source/VulkanExchange.cpp
    note  🔴 Fixed at device creation and never re-queried. Re-querying at a recording site is how a code

