T VulkanExchange                    | VulkanExchange.h | 43-86 | owning                    | -  | Holds the instance, the physical device, the created device and the one graphics queue. own identifiers wrapping them do not reuse the banned words those spellings contain.
    has   InstanceSlot       VkInstance        [-]  ?
    has   ScoredDeviceSlot   VkPhysicalDevice  [-]  ?
    has   ActiveDeviceSlot   VkDevice          [-]  ?
    has   GraphicsQueueSlot  VkQueue           [-]  ?
    has   ScoredCapability   CapabilitySet     [-]  ?
    has   DiagnosticEnabled  bool              [-]  ?
    by    Source/VulkanExchange.cpp
    note  Vendor spellings are verbatim at this surface — `VkDevice`, `VkQueue`, `VkPhysicalDevice`. Slate's

